cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the version that you used with the metadata
  from this file, and the paper that presents the framework, which is listed under
  references.
type: software
title: OpenNTN
abstract: >-
  An extension of the Sionna framework with the non-terrestrial network channel models
  of 3GPP TR 38.811 for the links between user terminals and a satellite or an aerial
  platform: dense urban, urban and suburban scenarios, S band and Ka band, uplink and
  downlink.
authors:
